      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1907, Stamford’s depot burned, yet sidings and tracks kept the village shipping wheat, corn, and livestock.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
